  "narrative": [
    {
      "text": "Hikami, Notes on construction of the knot invariant from the quantum dilogarithm function (RIMS Kôkyûroku) — knot invariants built from Faddeev's quantum dilogarithm.\n\n**Notes on Construction of the Knot Invariant from Quantum Dilogarithm Function** — Kazuhiro Hikami. RIMS Kôkyûroku proceedings.\n\nConstruction of knot invariants from the quantum dilogarithm, following the line from the Jones polynomial through the quantum-group invariants (HOMFLY, colored Jones, Kauffman) to the dilogarithmic ones.\n\n**Why it may bear here.** The quantum dilogarithm is the object this corpus's Φ_q / Li₂^q material is written in, and Kashaev's original link invariant (kashaev1995) is the paper this one builds on.\n\n**Extraction caveat.** The held scan is a RIMS volume with a broken text encoding — Japanese runs render as mojibake and TeX escapes appear literally, so the body is not reliably machine-readable and grep over its sections will miss things.",
